<title>HONG KONG: China United posts deeper interim loss.</title>
<headline>China United posts deeper interim loss.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.6 loss   vs 1.3 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  15.14 loss vs 2.73 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    26.41 loss vs 6.27 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     192.38     vs 152.57</p>
<p>    Company name		 China United Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - China United, formerly First Asia International Holdings Ltd, is a textiles, wood screws and metal fasteners maker and also invests in property.</p>
<p>Exceptional items represents loss on sale of an interest in a subsidiary and loss on dilution of equity interest in a subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
